            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kũkeethĩwa mũthenya ũsu, kĩtuu kĩnene kuma kwa Yeova kĩkeethĩwa katĩ wamo; na makakwatana kĩla ũmwe kw’oko na mũtũi wake, na kw’oko kwake kũkookĩlĩĩla kw’oko kwa mũtũi wake. ",
          "type": "text",
